<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Women's</p>
<p>European soccer Championship Group A played on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Karlstad</p>
<p>Sweden 3 France 0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers - Malin Andersson, 18th (penalty), Corinne Diacre</p>
<p>(own goal, 22nd), Kristin Jonsson (45th)</p>
<p>Attendance 2,751</p>
<p>In Karlskoga</p>
<p>Spain beat Russia 1-0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer - Angeles Parejo 67th</p>
<p>Attendance 408</p>
<p>Sweden and Spain qualify for the semi-finals from Group A.</p>
<p>On Sunday in Norway, Norway play Italy and Denmark play</p>
<p>Germany in the final Group B qualifying matches.</p>
</text>
